    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At sunset of the millennium, the original sin dragon reappeared in the Galan Castle, triggering a large-scale demonization across the Serert continent. When the bell of destruction rang through the sky, the flag that once brought peace rose again. Under the guidance of the holy sword Shionoway, the Diya mercenary group vowed to tear apart the dark night that enveloped the continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545810/extras/67a83e5ef0d31f6bac39e44bdcc4647c.poster.avif?t=1749466813\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545810/extras/67a83e5ef0d31f6bac39e44bdcc4647c.webm?t=1749466813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545810/extras/67a83e5ef0d31f6bac39e44bdcc4647c.mp4?t=1749466813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Galan War Song&quot; is a hardcore strategy game based on war chess and RPG elements. Players will play the role of &quot;Legendary King&quot; Bordo Diya, summon former mercenary group partners, go to Galan Castle, defeat the sin dragon, and save the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strong strategy turn-based RPG</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse mercenary designs: Warriors, swordsmen, fire mages, priests, and archers each have their own unique skill sets and combat styles;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful equipment system: In addition to the numerical values, 100+ pieces of equipment also come with various talents and skills;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special relic matching: By configuring the relic group before the battle, the mercenary group can be assisted to turn the tide of the battle;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Rich monster levels: 40+ different levels, monster bosses have their own new mechanisms, and the estimated campaign time is 30-40 hours;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong tactics, high strategy: All mercenaries are extremely powerful when used properly. All you have to do is to reasonably play their strengths on the premise of understanding the characteristics of the monsters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545810/extras/0ca8b36a804dfdabb899f16e4c0ceea1.poster.avif?t=1749466813\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545810/extras/0ca8b36a804dfdabb899f16e4c0ceea1.webm?t=1749466813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545810/extras/0ca8b36a804dfdabb899f16e4c0ceea1.mp4?t=1749466813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is not a traditional RPG, and you cannot crush monsters numerically by cultivating them! In terms of combat, it is a strategy game that requires patience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like our game, please add it to your wishlist!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At sunset of the millennium, the original sin dragon reappeared in the Galan Castle, triggering a large-scale demonization across the Serert continent. When the bell of destruction rang through the sky, the flag that once brought peace rose again. Under the guidance of the holy sword Shionoway, the Diya mercenary group vowed to tear apart the dark night that enveloped the continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545810/extras/67a83e5ef0d31f6bac39e44bdcc4647c.poster.avif?t=1749466813\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545810/extras/67a83e5ef0d31f6bac39e44bdcc4647c.webm?t=1749466813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545810/extras/67a83e5ef0d31f6bac39e44bdcc4647c.mp4?t=1749466813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Galan War Song&quot; is a hardcore strategy game based on war chess and RPG elements. Players will play the role of &quot;Legendary King&quot; Bordo Diya, summon former mercenary group partners, go to Galan Castle, defeat the sin dragon, and save the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strong strategy turn-based RPG</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse mercenary designs: Warriors, swordsmen, fire mages, priests, and archers each have their own unique skill sets and combat styles;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful equipment system: In addition to the numerical values, 100+ pieces of equipment also come with various talents and skills;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special relic matching: By configuring the relic group before the battle, the mercenary group can be assisted to turn the tide of the battle;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Rich monster levels: 40+ different levels, monster bosses have their own new mechanisms, and the estimated campaign time is 30-40 hours;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong tactics, high strategy: All mercenaries are extremely powerful when used properly. All you have to do is to reasonably play their strengths on the premise of understanding the characteristics of the monsters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545810/extras/0ca8b36a804dfdabb899f16e4c0ceea1.poster.avif?t=1749466813\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545810/extras/0ca8b36a804dfdabb899f16e4c0ceea1.webm?t=1749466813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3545810/extras/0ca8b36a804dfdabb899f16e4c0ceea1.mp4?t=1749466813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is not a traditional RPG, and you cannot crush monsters numerically by cultivating them! In terms of combat, it is a strategy game that requires patience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like our game, please add it to your wishlist!</p>",
